{"metadata":{"title":"addArc(center:radius:startAngle:endAngle:clockwise:transform:)","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addArc","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"center","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Point3DV","text":"Point3D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"radius","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"endAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clockwise","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transform","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AffineTransform3D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial17AffineTransform3DV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4PathV6addArc6center6radius10startAngle03endJ09clockwise9transformy0A7Spatial7Point3DV_SdAK7Angle2DVAOSbAK17AffineTransform3DVtF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/path\/addarc(center:radius:startangle:endangle:clockwise:transform:)"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addArc","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"center","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Point3D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Point3DV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"radius","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"endAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clockwise","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transform","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AffineTransform3D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial17AffineTransform3DV"},{"text":" = .identity)","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"center","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The center of the arc, in user space coordinates.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"radius","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The radius of the arc, in user space coordinates."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"startAngle","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The angle to the starting point of the arc, measured from the positive x-axis."}]}]},{"name":"endAngle","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The angle to the end point of the arc, measured from the positive x-axis.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"clockwise","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"True to make a clockwise arc; false to make a counterclockwise arc.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"transform","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An affine transform to apply to the arc before adding to the path. Defaults to the identity transform if not specified.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method calculates starting and ending points using the radius and angles you specify, uses a sequence of cubic Bézier curves to approximate a segment of a circle between those points, and then appends those curves to the path."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The clockwise parameter determines the direction in which the arc is created; the actual direction of the final path is dependent on the transform parameter and the current transform of a context where the path is drawn.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, because OpenSwiftUI by default uses a vertically-flipped coordinate system (with the origin in the top-left of the view), specifying a clockwise arc results in a counterclockwise arc after the transformation is applied.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the path ends with an unclosed subpath, this method adds a line connecting the current point to the starting point of the arc."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If there is no unclosed subpath, this method creates a new subpath whose starting point is the starting point of the arc."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The ending point of the arc becomes the new current point of the path."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds an arc of a circle to the path, specified with a radius and angles."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path"]]},"identifier":{"